    {
      "id": "gDzJy71ku_pujg5qXvfdm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1178.6666870117188,
      "y": 7030.666687011719,
      "width": 543.219970703125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 836112407,
      "version": 235,
      "versionNonce": 2066132089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770380897941,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "卸载分区，不能在dir(挂载的目录)里面操作得退出来再操作",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "卸载分区，不能在dir(挂载的目录)里面操作得退出来再操作",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JY9KQW_h2z0SCMzHaVObc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 810.6666870117188,
      "y": 7086.666687011719,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2023651799,
      "version": 225,
      "versionNonce": 1848994839,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770380976314,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果分区的挂载目录有重叠的部分，我们就近原则，那个的更近就是那个分区的\n但是实际中一般不会出现这种情况",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果分区的挂载目录有重叠的部分，我们就近原则，那个的更近就是那个分区的\n但是实际中一般不会出现这种情况",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mzkRaHp4hBr93hYEcgG_X",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 826.6666870117188,
      "y": 7149.3333740234375,
      "width": 525.219970703125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2104246713,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 750163641,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770381025016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这里的实验，被挂载到新的分区，dir里原来的文件可能会没\n但是卸载之后又恢复了",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这里的实验，被挂载到新的分区，dir里原来的文件可能会没\n但是卸载之后又恢复了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZpC7oQjytTKTePmyIugW0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 287.33343505859375,
      "y": 1325.1666870117188,
      "width": 796,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 472191858,
      "version": 944,
      "versionNonce": 1885725874,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1770433037003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果访问当前工作目录也需要知道它的 inode，而这个 inode 又需要通过上级目录才能获\n得，这似乎形成了一个递归依赖。实际上，系统是通过 从根目录开始逐级解析 的方式来解\n决的。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果访问当前工作目录也需要知道它的 inode，而这个 inode 又需要通过上级目录才能获得，这似乎形成了一个递归依赖。实际上，系统是通过 从根目录开始逐级解析 的方式来解决的。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
